# Email Configuration Quick Reference

Use this for testing with Gmail:

```bash
EMAIL_BACKEND=django.core.mail.backends.smtp.EmailBackend
EMAIL_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
EMAIL_PORT=587
EMAIL_USE_TLS=True
EMAIL_HOST_USER=arjungeriaagnisangha2013@gmail.com
EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=znng ocap udrf iyye
DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL=your-gmail@gmail.com
CONTACT_FORM_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=barammanik@gmail.com
```

For local testing (emails print to console):
```bash
EMAIL_BACKEND=django.core.mail.backends.console.EmailBackend
```

For Render production:
```bash
EMAIL_BACKEND=django.core.mail.backends.smtp.EmailBackend
EMAIL_HOST=smtp.sendgrid.net
EMAIL_PORT=587
EMAIL_USE_TLS=True
EMAIL_HOST_USER=apikey
EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=SG.your-sendgrid-api-key
DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@footballclub.com
CONTACT_FORM_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=barammanik@gmail.com
```
